# Changelog

All notable changes to this firmware are documented here.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-07-29

### Added
- Task 1: Payload Reader / Fragmenter — reads occultation event data,
  splits into fixed-size (32-byte) chunks.
- Task 2: FIFO Queue Manager — forwards chunks between queues, preserving
  order.
- Task 3: NGHam Encoder — encodes chunks into NGHam packets (CRC16 +
  Reed-Solomon FEC + framing).
- Task 4: Telemetry Monitor — reports queue occupancy, generation/
  transmission rates, and overflow counts once per second.
- Validated end-to-end on the FreeRTOS POSIX/Linux simulator.
- Restructured firmware directory to match SpaceLab TTC2 project layout
  (app/, config/, drivers/, freertos/).

### Pending
- Port to MSP430 target hardware.
- Reed-Solomon field polynomial alignment with official NGHam spec
  (currently uses 0x11D; spec requires 0x187 for byte-level
  interoperability with reference implementations).
